# IvorySQL Dev Plugin Settings

This is an example configuration file. Copy it to `ivorysql-dev.local.md` and customize.

```markdown
# IvorySQL Dev Settings

test_mode: ora  # Default test mode (pg/ora/all)
test_db_path: /home/ivorysql/test_oracle  # Test database path
test_db_auth: trust  # Authentication method
pg_port: 5432  # PostgreSQL port
ora_port: 1521  # Oracle port
docker_compose_cmd: "docker compose exec dev"  # Docker command
enable_code_format: false  # Auto-run pgindent
log_level: info  # Log level (error/warning/info/debug)
```
